{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:94a57e060bb50982ab367f54c1ca99002e9fb25ca47d8e356733330db9152176",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e0bfcd6a296c2e0ebdaf615e6f500c18aa0ff97972ac5425af93ea7b85edd6b",
      "text": "喂喂，我是神乐。我这边刚结束练习，\n正要离开公园。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24b4e81f2704b5c6f12a3666db34a219f18691d5bc14eaf24a38fca60b2092b2",
      "text": "多亏预留了充裕的时间，顺利达成了\n目标阶段的技巧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8c1327711037679bae521121fa7b3547ccf503dcd2c4e99b136958306577d8af",
      "text": "可以的话我想下周也留出时间。\n能拜托你帮忙协调吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3fadad763e0ebc1b8fcec1a15db9e400c87ef3d92d46d5a45197ac093cc4c66",
      "text": "好的，没问题",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e0b8a523dce367faa4b2cacf8af4e6fce2398b767caa3e9206a19310bff5e1f",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:044885a26a0bba031c79c6f80f85ae0367ab2d06aea0557e4ec2b462fbfd69f9",
      "text": "身体不累吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000019:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:980172cb006ba827fb5426bb9e16c36769e6515f69de593a987efe843712bd58",
      "text": "请不要太勉强\n自己哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d995cd9f01b1626eee2d991a859e6e74f61338edeb5fde710b177b362ffa3c8c",
      "text": "虽然也有辛苦的地方，但现在我纯粹觉得\n练习非常快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bab65fbbe7a850efdb37e2a2889619ae5dee12997392c667aeac3ce034b22fe5",
      "text": "为了工作参考而观看职业选手的视频时，\n不知不觉受了感染也说不定呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:199111cf980a00392e94bcf720e14dbb034154ce0e4c39be3e86d1d76829bbfc",
      "text": "当然，我会注意不让自己受伤、\n以免影响到正式拍摄当天的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19b09a0f994d47a436a93aa573b25a964b2a50a7c11fbfb8b92599f58e64b73d",
      "text": "因为在正式拍摄当天之前，\n我还有想要掌握的特技动作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000030:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8a5240e0e693d952bdd3dcffcb6b35e32d6b071ddc5d275a9cf8b27980573b0",
      "text": "如果日程没有问题的话，\n我想把更多的时间投入到练习中。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_403_2_4_008_03_09_b:2_4_008_03_09_b:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a56ef0ab06af96e4d6dd5360adf769bf5d3ef7e9f6216a3351ff5e7ea827f3b7",
      "text": "调整好之后请告诉我。\n那么，我这边也会再联系你。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
